#. module: choreograph_sale_project
#: model:mail.template,body_html:choreograph_sale_project.email_template_choreograph_delivery
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"                        <t t-set=\"info_task\" t-value=\"object.tasks_ids.filtered(lambda t: t.task_number == '75')\"></t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.project_ids[0].stage_id.stage_number == '50'\">\n"
"                            <t t-set=\"info_task\" t-value=\"object.tasks_ids.filtered(lambda t: t.task_number == '85')\"></t>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"info_task\">\n"
"                            <t t-set=\"delivery_address\" t-value=\"info_task.provider_delivery_address\"></t>\n"
"                            <t t-set=\"file_name\" t-value=\"info_task.provider_file_name\"></t>\n"
"                            Hello,\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            Kindly find on your\n"
"                            <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"object.receiver\"></span>\n"
"                            FTP the file from choreograph for the\n"
"                            <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-esc=\"object.get_operation_template_name()\"></span>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            Campaign\n"
"                            <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"></span>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            The file name is\n"
"                            <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"file_name\"></span>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            The distribution of addresses is as follows:\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <t t-set=\"segments\" t-value=\"info_task.segment_ids\"></t>\n"
"                            <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"1\"></t>\n"
"                            <t t-foreach=\"segments\" t-as=\"segment\">\n"
"                                Segment<t t-out=\"count\"></t>:\n"
"                                <t t-out=\"segment.name\"></t>\n"
"                                <br>\n"
"                                Quantity:\n"
"                                <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"segment.quantity\"></span>\n"
"                                <br>\n"
"                                Keycode:\n"
"                                <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"segment.keycode\"></span>\n"
"                                <br>\n"
"                                <br>\n"
"                                <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"count + 1\"></t>\n"
"                            </t>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <span style=\"color: green;\">IMPORTANT: Please confirm receipt of the file at</span>\n"
"                            <a href=\"mailto:production.data@choreograph.com\"><u>production.data@choreograph.com</u></a>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            The password is: <span style=\"font-size: 1.2em;\">xxxxxxx</span>.\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Please note that between the delivery date of these addresses and their use, some individuals may have exercised their right to object. You will find below the link to the file of opt-out addresses to be removed before dropping your campaigns : <br><a href=\"https://conexancegdpr.blob.core.windows.net/optouts/UK_GDPR_OPTOUTS.txt\" target=\"_blank\">https://conexancegdpr.blob.core.windows.net/optouts/UK_GDPR_OPTOUTS.txt </a>\n"
"<br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            For any questions, please contact:\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <a href=\"mailto:production.data@choreograph.com\"><u>production.data@choreograph.com</u></a>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            Regards,\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            Production Service\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"                        <t t-set=\"info_task\" t-value=\"object.tasks_ids.filtered(lambda t: t.task_number == '75')\"></t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.project_ids[0].stage_id.stage_number == '50'\">\n"
"                            <t t-set=\"info_task\" t-value=\"object.tasks_ids.filtered(lambda t: t.task_number == '85')\"></t>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"info_task\">\n"
"                            <t t-set=\"delivery_address\" t-value=\"info_task.provider_delivery_address\"></t>\n"
"                            <t t-set=\"file_name\" t-value=\"info_task.provider_file_name\"></t>\n"
"                            Bonjour,\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            Veuillez trouver sur votre FTP le fichier source choreograph pour la campagne de\n"
"                            <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"object.get_operation_template_name()\"></span> / <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"></span> / <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"object.name\"></span>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            La répartition des adresses est la suivante :\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <t t-set=\"segments\" t-value=\"info_task.segment_ids\"></t>\n"
"                            <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"1\"></t>\n"
"                            <t t-foreach=\"segments\" t-as=\"segment\">\n"
"                                Segment<t t-out=\"count\"></t>:\n"
"                                <t t-out=\"segment.name\"></t>\n"
"                                <br>\n"
"                                Quantité:\n"
"                                <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"segment.quantity\"></span>\n"
"                                <br>\n"
"                                Keycode:\n"
"                                <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-out=\"segment.keycode\"></span>\n"
"                                <br>\n"
"                                <br>\n"
"                                <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"count + 1\"></t>\n"
"                            </t>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <span style=\"color: green;\">IMPORTANT : merci de bien vouloir confirmer la réception du fichier à</span>\n"
"                            <a href=\"mailto:production.data@choreograph.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none;box-sizing:border-box;color:#008f8c;\"><u>production.data@choreograph.com</u></a>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            Voici le mot de passe : <span style=\"font-size: 1.2em;\">xxxxxxx</span>.\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Veuillez noter qu'entre la date de livraison de ces adresses et leur utilisation, certaines personnes pourraient avoir exercé leur droit d'opposition. Vous trouverez ci-dessous le lien vers le fichier des adresses opt-out à supprimer avant le dépôt de vos campagnes :<br>\n"
"<a href=\"https://conexancegdpr.blob.core.windows.net/optouts/FR_GDPR_OPTOUTS.txt\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none;box-sizing:border-box;color:#008f8c;\">https://conexancegdpr.blob.core.windows.net/optouts/FR_GDPR_OPTOUTS.txt&nbsp;</a>\n"
"<br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            Pour toute question, n’hésitez pas à contacter :\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <a href=\"mailto:production.data@choreograph.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none;box-sizing:border-box;color:#008f8c;\"><u>production.data@choreograph.com</u></a>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            Cordialement,\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            <br>\n"
"                            Le service de production\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "

